  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kommerskollegium 2011-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Board of Trade 2011- 2014 - National Board of Trade 2011-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kommerskollegium har som m&#xe5;l med utvecklingssamarbetet att, med       Sveriges Politik f&#xf6;r Global Utveckling som grund, bidra till ett      r&#xe4;ttvist och h&#xe5;llbart global utveckling, bidra till att &#xf6;ka           utvecklingsl&#xe4;ndernas integrering i den internationella handeln och    utifr&#xe5;n myndighetens unika kompetens bidra till att st&#xe4;rka statliga   institutioner som arbetar med handelsfr&#xe5;gor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The National Board of Trade&apos;s goal with the development cooperation,  in line with the Swedish Policy for Global Development, is to         contribute to an equitable and sustainable global development,        contribute to increase the integration of developing countries in     international trade and by reference to its expertise contribute to   the strengthening of state institutions that work with trade issues.</narrative>
  </description>
